  <h2>Polki at Vaishnavi Jewels</h2>
  <p>We make Polki chokers, raani haars and long necklaces, full bridal sets, earrings and jhumkas, maang tikkas, bangles and kadas, often combined with emeralds, rubies and pearls. Pieces range from heavy bridal sets to light festive and gifting pieces.</p>
  <figure class="vj-fig"><div class="vj-fig-frame"><img class="vj-photo-img" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/design_gemini/vs2_bridal_s4_20261012171130" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_480/vj/design_gemini/vs2_bridal_s4_20261012171130 480w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/design_gemini/vs2_bridal_s4_20261012171130 720w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_960/vj/design_gemini/vs2_bridal_s4_20261012171130 960w" sizes="(max-width: 520px) 92vw, 460px" width="720" height="900" alt="Close-up of a polki and emerald necklace with matching earrings" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="vj-mark sm" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logo_mark_on_dark.png" alt="" width="45" height="30" loading="lazy" /></span></div></figure>

  <h2>Customisation</h2>
  <p>Designs can be adjusted in size, stone colours and layout to suit your outfit and occasion. Visit the showroom or book a video call to see pieces up close. Planning a wedding? See <a href="/bridal-jewellery">Bridal jewellery</a>.</p>

  <h2>Hallmarked gold, delivered across India</h2>
  <p>Our gold jewellery is BIS HUID hallmarked and every piece comes with an itemised invoice. See our showroom at Rajhans Ornate Mall, Parle Point, or shop on a video call with free insured delivery to major Indian cities: <a href="/visit-us">Visit our showroom</a> &middot; <a href="/delivery-across-india">Delivery across India</a> &middot; <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>.</p>

  <p>Read more: <a href="/blog/polki-vs-jadau-guide">Polki vs Jadau &ndash; what's the difference?</a></p>
</InfoPage>
